###

### GET properties with pagination page 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?page=0&size=1

###

### GET properties with pagination page 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?page=1&size=1

###

### GET properties invalid pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?page=-1&size=0

###

### FILTER by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?status=SOLD

###

### FILTER by location
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?location=cluj

###

### FILTER by min/max price
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?minPrice=100000&maxPrice=200000

###

### FILTER combined
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?status=SOLD&location=cluj&minPrice=100000&maxPrice=200000

