###

### GRAPHQL request viewing as normal user
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation ($propertyId: String!, $date: String!, $client: String!) { requestViewing(propertyId: $propertyId, date: $date, client: $client) { id propertyId date client status requestedByUsername } }",
  "variables": {
    "propertyId": "{{propertyId}}",
    "date": "2027-01-01 10:00",
    "client": "user"
  }
}

