### GRAPHQL update viewing as admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "query": "mutation ($id: String!, $propertyId: String!, $date: String!, $client: String!) { updateViewing(id: $id, propertyId: $propertyId, date: $date, client: $client) { id propertyId date client status } }",
